From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eduardo Ruiz <335073+eduarbo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 23:59:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Pause the views' videos and slideshows after a minute without
 input

- After IdlePause seconds without input (default 60; 0 never), a theme's
  video stops at the end of its loop and shows its snapshot or what is under
  it (IdlePauseVideo), and the system view's panel moves on to no other
  suggestion; slideshows end the change under way and stay on their capture
  (IdlePauseSlides). Any input resumes them. Screen saver videos are not
  paused.
---
